SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    pH        5
    pe        4
    units     mmol/kgw
    C(4)      0.5
    Mn        1.0

KINETICS 1
Calcite
    -m0    1.0
    -m     1.0
    -parms 10.0  0.6
    -steps 1000 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file   calcite_kinetic4.out
    -reset  false
    -step   true
    -time   true
    -totals C Mn Ca

END
